\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Inflow-parameter evolution over the four assimilation windows (shaded/unshaded bands). \textbf  {Top/middle:} prior ensemble (orange) and posterior ensemble (blue) for the inflow angle and velocity magnitude, with the PALM{} truth dashed. The posterior tightens sharply relative to the prior; the angle tracks the truth, while the speed is biased high. \textbf  {Bottom:} domain-averaged velocity-magnitude RMSE of the posterior state over the full $120$-step horizon, which stays bounded across all four windows (no rollout divergence under assimilation).\relax }}{11}{figure.caption.9}\protected@file@percent }
